msgstr "未听支付"

msgid "Notenrenchan"
msgstr "未听连庄"

msgid "Now that it's your turn, try issuing a challenge now with the leftmost button."
msgstr "现在轮到你了，试着用最左边的按钮发出挑战。"

msgid "Now that you are out of flowers, press No Flowers to pass the turn. (IRL you would say \\\"Pass\\\")."
msgstr "既然你已经没有花牌了，按下「无花」来跳过回合。（现实中你会说「Pass」。）"

msgid "Now you have four sets and a pair! Click Tsumo to declare a win!"
msgstr "现在你有四组面子及一个对子！点击自摸来宣告和牌！"

msgid "Now you must discard a tile."
msgstr "现在你必须打出一张牌。"

