msgid "Oka applies directly to chips."
msgstr "折返直接套用于筹码。"

msgid "Okay, do you go for the wider wait by declaring riichi on the wind, or jump for the funny wind wait by discarding 8 of bamboo?"
msgstr "好，你是要宣告立直于风牌以追求更宽的听牌，还是打出八索来追求那个有趣的风牌听？"

msgid "On ron, each 1s (bird) tile is worth 1 shuugi, unless the discarder's hand contains 7p (pistol) which would shoot the birds dead. That is, unless the winner's hand contains 8s (birdcage) which would protect the birds from gunfire."
msgstr "荣和时，每张一索（鸟）价值 1 个筹码，除非放铳者的手牌含有七筒（手枪）会将鸟击毙。也就是说，除非和牌者的手牌含有八索（鸟笼）能保护鸟免受枪击。"

msgid "On top of our mixed straight, we get our two flower tiles, plus All Chows (all sequences plus non-honor pair), totalling 12 points."
msgstr "除了我们的混合顺之外，我们还获得两张花牌，加上全顺子（全顺子加上非字牌对子），总计 12 点。"

msgid "One Flower"
msgstr "一花"

msgid "One Kong"
msgstr "一杠"

msgid "One Suji Only"
msgstr "仅一筋"

