msgid "South just discarded a west wind. Because you have one of each other wind, you can call Fuun to declare an open mixed quad of winds (fuutsu)! Try it now."
msgstr "南家刚打出一张西风。由于你拥有其他每种风牌各一张，你可以鸣风云来宣告一组明风混合杠（风杠）！现在就试试。"

msgid "South just played a bamboo tile! If we're going for half flush, we'll probably want to take it. Call chii!"
msgstr "南家刚打出一张索子！如果我们要做混一色，我们大概会想要它。鸣吃！"

msgid "South just played a tile that matches one in your hand. Because of this, you can call ton on the tile to call a pair. Try it!"
msgstr "南家刚打出一张与你手中相符的牌。因此，你可以鸣 Ton 该牌来鸣对子。试试看！"

